TROUBLESHOOTING.md
IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md
SPORTS_CONFIGURATION_GUIDE.md
STANDINGS_AND_GIT_SETUP.md
SECURITY_FIX_INSTRUCTIONS.md
QUICK_START_GUIDE.md

